cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Nếu sử dụng LiveLift trong nghiên cứu, vui lòng trích dẫn như sau."
title: "LiveLift: Causal Experimentation Infrastructure for Live Commerce Operations"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "LiveLift Team (AISC'26)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bminhnemhoi/AISC2026_LIVEFIT"
license: AGPL-3.0
date-released: "2026-09-03"
keywords:
  - switchback experiments
  - causal inference
  - live commerce
  - randomization inference
  - vietnamese nlp
abstract: >-
  A control-desk platform that turns in-session live-commerce decisions into
  valid randomized experiments via a two-tier switchback design, with
  studentized randomization inference validated end-to-end on a simulator
  calibrated against KuaiLive (SIGIR 2026).
